  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/057bf473-71e7-4833-aebb-13ad817aefd1-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 199px;\" /><br /><br />Given, area of the equilateral triangle inscribed in the circle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>, hence<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Again, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the radius of a circle, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p>",
